.phpunit.cache

# resources/dist is deliberately committed — Composer ships only repo content, so
# without the built bundles there is nothing for a consumer to publish. The hot file
# is the one thing in there that must never ship: `npm run dev` writes it, and in a
# consumer it would make Vite::isRunningHot() true and point every asset URL at a dev
# server on localhost that isn't running.
/resources/dist/hot
